# Project: Risk

Purpose:
  Define the risk register schema for a project instance.
  This file defines the SHAPE only — concrete risks belong to the
  instantiated project.

Schema:
  id
  area
  risk
  probability
  impact
  trigger
  mitigation
  owner

Example:
  #RISK-004

  Area:
    Database

  Risk:
    PostgreSQL becomes bottleneck

  Probability:
    medium

  Impact:
    high

  Trigger:
      CPU > 75%

  Mitigation:
      indexing
      caching
      read replica

  Owner:
      DB / DO

Rules:
  [PR1] AI MUST consult the risk register when proposing architecture or
        implementation changes.
  [PR2] Every risk MUST have an owner.
  [PR3] Every risk MUST have defined mitigation.
  [PR4] Risk register MUST be updated when risks change.

Navigation:
  Schema: @schema.sdd
  Architecture: @architecture.sdd

State: +
